{"id": "eval-chunk-01", "text": "Nightly database backups run at 02:00 UTC and are retained for thirty days before deletion.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/backup_policy.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-01", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-01", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-02", "text": "Remote staff connect through the corporate VPN using a hardware token issued by the security desk.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/vpn_access.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-02", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-02", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-03", "text": "Meal expenses are reimbursed up to forty dollars per day without an itemised receipt.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/expense_meals.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-03", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-03", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-04", "text": "New joiners collect a laptop from the IT desk on their first working day.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/onboarding_laptop.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-04", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-04", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-05", "text": "A severity one incident pages the on-call engineer within five minutes of detection.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/incident_severity.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-05", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-05", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-06", "text": "Service account passwords rotate automatically every ninety days.", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/password_rotation.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-06", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-06", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-07", "text": "员工每年享有十五天带薪年假，未使用的年假可以结转到次年三月底。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/nianjia.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-07", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-07", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-08", "text": "差旅报销需要在行程结束后十个工作日内提交发票和审批单。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/chailv_baoxiao.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-08", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-08", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-09", "text": "考勤记录每月一号生成，迟到超过三次系统会发出提醒。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/kaoqin.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-09", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-09", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-10", "text": "社保缴纳基数在每年七月根据上一年度的平均工资进行调整。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/shebao.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-10", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-10", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-11", "text": "新员工必须在入职三个月内完成信息安全培训课程并通过考核。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/anquan_peixun.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-11", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-11", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-12", "text": "离职申请需要提前三十天以书面形式提交给直属主管。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/lizhi_liucheng.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-12", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-12", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-13", "text": "女员工产假为一百五十八天，其中产前可以休假十五天。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/chanjia.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-13", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-13", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-14", "text": "男员工陪产假为十五天，须在配偶分娩后三个月内休完。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/peichanjia.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-14", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-14", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
{"id": "eval-chunk-15", "text": "病假需要提交二级以上医院出具的诊断证明。", "metadata": {"source": "eval://corpus/bingjia.md", "document_id": "eval-doc-15", "version": 1, "page": 1, "chunk_id": "eval-chunk-15", "tenant_id": "eval-tenant", "owner_user_id": "eval-user", "visibility": "private", "acl_tags": ""}}
